UPDATE tools SET faq = $x$[{"q": "What is Synthesis?", "a": "Synthesis is an AI-powered learning company with two products: Synthesis Tutor, an adaptive math program for ages 5-11, and Synthesis Teams, a game-based problem-solving and critical-thinking program for ages 8-14. The company originated in 2014 when founder Josh Dahn was asked by Elon Musk to launch an experimental school for SpaceX employees' children, before opening its programs to the public."}, {"q": "Is Synthesis free?", "a": "Synthesis has no free plan. It offers a 7-day free trial on its Individual and Family subscription plans, but not on Lifetime purchases. Individual plans and Family plans (covering up to 7 children) are available on monthly, annual, or one-time lifetime billing, with sale pricing changing periodically on the vendor's site. It's positioned as a premium education supplement rather than a replacement for school."}, {"q": "What is the difference between Synthesis and Khan Academy?", "a": "Khan Academy is a broad free education platform covering all subjects with video lessons and practice problems. Synthesis focuses specifically on math and problem-solving through games, using a different pedagogical approach. Synthesis is premium; Khan Academy is free. Khanmigo adds AI tutoring to Khan Academy."}]$x$::jsonb
